"Both buttons write the same five settings at once: naming template, "
"absolute episode numbers, language separation, English subtitle downloads"
" and movie subfolders. The dialog asks whether the folder and file "
"structure should be set too, so you can take the rest and keep your own "
"naming template. Nothing else is touched, and files already on disk are "
"never renamed."
