msgstr ""

#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:2088
msgid ""
"The audit log lives in its own database file so it survives a snapshot "
"restore or a backup import. Entries are append-only and hash-chained: "
"removing one from the middle breaks the chain and is detected by "
"“Verify”. Sensitive values are never recorded — only the fact that they "
"changed."
